{"seq":1,"slug":"async-contract-testing","title":"异步消息契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/async-contract-testing","wordCount":1330,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步消息契约测试\">异步消息契约测试</h1><h2 id=\"异步通信的契约挑战\">异步通信的契约挑战</h2><p>现代分布式架构越来越多地采用异步消息通信——Kafka、RabbitMQ、AWS SQS/SNS、Azure Event Hub。消息队列解耦了服务间的时序依赖，但引入了新的契约问题：<strong>生产者发送的消息格式变更后，消费者可能在数小时或数天后才消费到不兼容的消息并崩溃</strong>。</p>\n<p>与 HTTP 接口不同，异步消息的契约测试面临几个独特挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>HTTP 契约</th>\n<th>消息契约</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互模式</td>\n<td>请求-响应对</td>\n<td>单向消息（Fire-and-Forget）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序</td>\n<td>同步即时反馈</td>\n<td>异步延迟消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n<td>状态码/响应体直接可见</td>\n<td>消息在队列中不可直接观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误反馈</td>\n<td>调用方立刻得到错误响应</td>\n<td>消费者处理失败进死信队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议抽象</td>\n<td>URL + HTTP 方法</td>\n<td>Topic + 消息格式 + 元数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[消息生产者] --&gt;|发布| Q[消息队列&lt;br/&gt;Kafka / RabbitMQ]&#10;    Q --&gt;|订阅| C1[消费者 A]&#10;    Q --&gt;|订阅| C2[消费者 B]&#10;    Q --&gt;|订阅| C3[消费者 C]&#10;&#10;    P -.-&gt;|契约保护| CONTRACT[消息契约]&#10;    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C1&#10;    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C2&#10;    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C3\">flowchart LR\n    P[消息生产者] --&gt;|发布| Q[消息队列&lt;br/&gt;Kafka / RabbitMQ]\n    Q --&gt;|订阅| C1[消费者 A]\n    Q --&gt;|订阅| C2[消费者 B]\n    Q --&gt;|订阅| C3[消费者 C]\n\n    P -.-&gt;|契约保护| CONTRACT[消息契约]\n    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C1\n    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C2\n    CONTRACT -.-&gt;|验证| C3</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>异步契约测试的核心概念包括：<strong>Message Pact</strong>——Pact 对消息交互的抽象（抽离传输协议，只关注 payload 和 metadata）；<strong>Message Provider</strong>——提供者验证时调用的消息生成函数（无需真实队列）；<strong>Event Envelope</strong>——消息的标准信封结构（元数据 + 业务负载分离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Message Pact 让异步交互的契约验证与同步 HTTP 交互同构</li>\n<li>Message Provider 是提供者端的验证入口，应调用真实业务逻辑生成消息</li>\n<li>Event Envelope 标准化消息结构，使契约能同时覆盖元数据和业务字段</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pact-message-pact-机制\">Pact Message Pact 机制</h2><p>Pact 通过 Message Pact 将消息交互抽象为与 HTTP 交互同构的契约模型。核心思想是：<strong>抽象掉传输协议（Kafka/RabbitMQ/SQS），只关注消息的内容（payload）和元数据（metadata）</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"消费者侧-定义期望的消息格式\">消费者侧：定义期望的消息格式</h3><p>消费者声明它能处理什么格式的消息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { PactV4, MatchersV3 } from &#39;@pact-foundation/pact&#39;;&#10;const { like, string, integer, iso8601, eachLike } = MatchersV3;&#10;&#10;const messagePact = new PactV4({&#10;  consumer: &#39;NotificationService&#39;,&#10;  provider: &#39;OrderService&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;Order Created event contract&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;can handle an order.created message&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    await messagePact&#10;      .addAsynchronousInteraction()&#10;      .given(&#39;an order has been placed&#39;)&#10;      .expectsToReceive(&#39;an order.created event&#39;)&#10;      .withRequest((builder) =&gt; {&#10;        builder&#10;          .withJSONContent({&#10;            orderId: string(&#39;ord-abc-123&#39;),&#10;            customerId: string(&#39;cust-456&#39;),&#10;            items: eachLike({&#10;              productId: string(&#39;prod-789&#39;),&#10;              quantity: integer(2),&#10;              unitPrice: like(29.99),&#10;            }),&#10;            totalAmount: like(59.98),&#10;            createdAt: iso8601(),&#10;          })&#10;          .withMetadata({&#10;            &#39;content-type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;            topic: &#39;order-events&#39;,&#10;            eventType: &#39;order.created&#39;,&#10;          });&#10;      })&#10;      .executeTest(async (message) =&gt; {&#10;        // 调用消费者的消息处理函数&#10;        const handler = new OrderCreatedHandler();&#10;        await handler.handle(message.contents);&#10;        // 断言处理结果（如通知被创建）&#10;      });&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PactV4, MatchersV3 } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pact-foundation/pact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">iso8601</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eachLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MatchersV3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> messagePact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PactV4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NotificationService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Order Created event contract'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'can handle an order.created message'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> messagePact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addAsynchronousInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'an order has been placed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expectsToReceive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'an order.created event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withJSONContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            orderId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ord-abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            customerId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cust-456'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            items: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eachLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              productId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prod-789'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              quantity: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              unitPrice: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">29.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            totalAmount: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">59.98</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            createdAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iso8601</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'content-type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            topic: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-events'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            eventType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">executeTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 调用消费者的消息处理函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderCreatedHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handler.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message.contents);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 断言处理结果（如通知被创建）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提供者侧-验证能产出符合契约的消息\">提供者侧：验证能产出符合契约的消息</h3><p>提供者验证时，不需要真的连接消息队列。只需提供一个<strong>消息生成函数</strong>（Message Provider），Pact 调用它获取消息内容，与契约比对：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const verifier = new Verifier({&#10;  provider: &#39;OrderService&#39;,&#10;  pactBrokerUrl: &#39;https://broker.example.com&#39;,&#10;  providerVersion: process.env.GIT_SHA,&#10;  messageProviders: {&#10;    &#39;an order.created event&#39;: async () =&gt; {&#10;      // 调用真实的消息构建逻辑&#10;      const order = await orderService.createOrder({&#10;        customerId: &#39;cust-456&#39;,&#10;        items: [{ productId: &#39;prod-789&#39;, quantity: 2, unitPrice: 29.99 }],&#10;      });&#10;      return orderEventBuilder.buildCreatedEvent(order);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  stateHandlers: {&#10;    &#39;an order has been placed&#39;: async () =&gt; {&#10;      await seedTestOrder();&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> verifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Verifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pactBrokerUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://broker.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providerVersion: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GIT_SHA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messageProviders: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'an order.created event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 调用真实的消息构建逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        customerId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cust-456'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        items: [{ productId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prod-789'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quantity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, unitPrice: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">29.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderEventBuilder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildCreatedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stateHandlers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'an order has been placed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> seedTestOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消息契约的设计模式\">消息契约的设计模式</h2><h3 id=\"事件信封模式-event-envelope\">事件信封模式（Event Envelope）</h3><p>为消息定义统一的信封结构，将元数据与业务负载分离：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EventEnvelope&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  eventId: string; // 幂等键&#10;  eventType: string; // 事件类型标识&#10;  version: string; // 消息 Schema 版本&#10;  timestamp: string; // ISO 8601 时间戳&#10;  source: string; // 生产者服务标识&#10;  correlationId?: string; // 链路追踪 ID&#10;  payload: T; // 业务负载&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventEnvelope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 事件类型标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消息 Schema 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ISO 8601 时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产者服务标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  correlationId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 链路追踪 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 业务负载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>契约测试应同时覆盖信封字段和业务负载字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信封字段</th>\n<th>契约匹配策略</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>eventId</td>\n<td><code>uuid()</code></td>\n<td>确保唯一性格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eventType</td>\n<td><code>string(&#39;order.created&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>消费者路由依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>version</td>\n<td><code>regex(&#39;^\\\\d+\\\\.\\\\d+$&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>版本格式约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td><code>iso8601()</code></td>\n<td>时间格式标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>payload</td>\n<td>按业务字段逐一匹配</td>\n<td>核心业务契约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多版本消息兼容\">多版本消息兼容</h3><p>消息的 Schema 演进需要特别注意向后兼容。常见策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    V1[消息 v1&lt;br/&gt;orderId + items] --&gt;|添加字段| V2[消息 v2&lt;br/&gt;orderId + items + discount]&#10;    V2 --&gt;|消费者未升级| C_OLD[旧消费者&lt;br/&gt;忽略 discount]&#10;    V2 --&gt;|消费者已升级| C_NEW[新消费者&lt;br/&gt;使用 discount]&#10;&#10;    V1 -.-&gt;|契约 v1| CONTRACT1[只验证 orderId + items]&#10;    V2 -.-&gt;|契约 v2| CONTRACT2[验证全部字段]\">flowchart TD\n    V1[消息 v1&lt;br/&gt;orderId + items] --&gt;|添加字段| V2[消息 v2&lt;br/&gt;orderId + items + discount]\n    V2 --&gt;|消费者未升级| C_OLD[旧消费者&lt;br/&gt;忽略 discount]\n    V2 --&gt;|消费者已升级| C_NEW[新消费者&lt;br/&gt;使用 discount]\n\n    V1 -.-&gt;|契约 v1| CONTRACT1[只验证 orderId + items]\n    V2 -.-&gt;|契约 v2| CONTRACT2[验证全部字段]</pre><p><strong>规则</strong>：添加可选字段是安全的（向后兼容），移除字段或改变现有字段类型是破坏性变更（需要消费者先升级）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"消息头-metadata-的契约覆盖\">消息头（Metadata）的契约覆盖</h3><p>消息元数据往往包含路由、过滤和处理控制信息，对消费者同样重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 消费者可能依赖特定的 metadata 进行路由&#10;const metadata = {&#10;  &#39;content-type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;  &#39;x-event-type&#39;: string(&#39;order.created&#39;),&#10;  &#39;x-correlation-id&#39;: regex(/^[0-9a-f-]{36}$/),&#10;  &#39;x-schema-version&#39;: string(&#39;2.0&#39;),&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费者可能依赖特定的 metadata 进行路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'content-type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'x-event-type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'x-correlation-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[0-9a-f-]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{36}$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'x-schema-version'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kafka-特有的契约考量\">Kafka 特有的契约考量</h2><p>Kafka 作为最流行的事件流平台，有几个特殊的契约测试考量：</p>\n<p><strong>Key 的契约</strong>：Kafka 消息的 Key 决定分区分配和顺序保证。如果消费者依赖特定的 Key 格式（如 <code>{customerId}</code> 用于保证同一客户的事件有序），Key 的格式应纳入契约。</p>\n<p><strong>Schema Registry 集成</strong>：在使用 Confluent Schema Registry 的架构中，Avro/Protobuf Schema 本身充当了一层契约。Pact 契约测试可以作为补充——验证运行时行为而非仅 Schema 兼容。</p>\n<p><strong>消费者组语义</strong>：不同消费者组可能对同一 Topic 的消息有不同的处理期望。每个消费者组应有独立的契约，而非共享一份。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异步契约测试的常见陷阱\">异步契约测试的常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱 1：测试序列化而非业务逻辑</strong>。消息契约应验证&quot;消费者能正确处理这个消息格式&quot;，而非仅验证 JSON 反序列化。在 <code>executeTest</code> 中应调用真实的消息处理逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 2：忽略错误消息的契约</strong>。只为正常消息编写契约，忽略了消费者需要处理的错误场景（如补偿事件、重试消息）。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 3：过度耦合传输层细节</strong>。契约不应依赖特定队列实现（如 Kafka 的 partition key、RabbitMQ 的 routing key），除非消费者的正确性依赖于这些信息。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 4：Provider State 与消息生成逻辑不匹配</strong>。提供者验证时的消息生成函数应尽量调用真实的业务逻辑（而非手工构造 JSON），否则验证结果可能与生产行为不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>异步消息的契约测试通过 Pact Message Pact 机制，将传输协议（Kafka/RabbitMQ/SQS）与消息内容解耦，让消费者和提供者能独立验证消息格式的兼容性。关键实践包括：使用 Event Envelope 模式标准化消息结构、为消息头和业务负载分别编写契约、注意多版本消息的向后兼容性规则。异步场景的契约保护对事件驱动架构的稳定性至关重要。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：下一篇 <a href=\"graphql-grpc-contracts\">GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约</a> 将覆盖其他非 REST 协议的契约测试方案。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步消息契约测试","id":"异步消息契约测试"},{"level":2,"text":"异步通信的契约挑战","id":"异步通信的契约挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pact Message Pact 机制","id":"pact-message-pact-机制"},{"level":3,"text":"消费者侧：定义期望的消息格式","id":"消费者侧-定义期望的消息格式"},{"level":3,"text":"提供者侧：验证能产出符合契约的消息","id":"提供者侧-验证能产出符合契约的消息"},{"level":2,"text":"消息契约的设计模式","id":"消息契约的设计模式"},{"level":3,"text":"事件信封模式（Event Envelope）","id":"事件信封模式-event-envelope"},{"level":3,"text":"多版本消息兼容","id":"多版本消息兼容"},{"level":3,"text":"消息头（Metadata）的契约覆盖","id":"消息头-metadata-的契约覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka 特有的契约考量","id":"kafka-特有的契约考量"},{"level":2,"text":"异步契约测试的常见陷阱","id":"异步契约测试的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"替代工具与工具选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/alternative-tools"},"next":{"title":"GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/graphql-grpc-contracts"}}